      "en": "and in all the mighty hand, and in all the awesome deeds, which Moses did in the sight of all Israel.",
      "ko": "모든 큰 권능과 위엄을 행하게 하시매 온 이스라엘 목전에서 그것을 행한 자더라",
      "source_text_hash": "cdab53b0af9309d5f3c00c2e868e36c02b2284ffb365796172b244eed1e4b195",
      "translation_text_hash": "c9b2d3d5e046af9dc997f370a3aa1774ba948df8e08fb733afbca10f7bda7527",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
